```jsp
<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %>
<%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <title>Room Allocation List</title>

</head>

<body>

    <h2>Room Allocation List</h2>

    <!-- Add Allocation -->

    <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/allocation/add">
        Add New Allocation
    </a>

    <br><br>


    <!-- =====================================================
         SEARCH
         ===================================================== -->

    <form action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/allocation/list"
          method="get">

        <label>Search:</label>

        <input type="text"
               name="keyword"
               value="${keyword}"
               placeholder="Student name, Student ID, Room number, Room ID or Status">

        <button type="submit">
            Search
        </button>

        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/allocation/list">
            Clear
        </a>

    </form>

    <br>


    <!-- =====================================================
         TOTAL ALLOCATIONS
         ===================================================== -->

    <p>
        Total Allocations:
        <strong>${allocations.size()}</strong>
    </p>


    <!-- =====================================================
         ALLOCATION TABLE
         ===================================================== -->

    <c:choose>

        <c:when test="${not empty allocations}">

            <table border="1"
                   cellpadding="10"
                   cellspacing="0">

                <thead>

                    <tr>

                        <th>ID</th>

                        <th>Student ID</th>

                        <th>Student Name</th>

                        <th>Room ID</th>

                        <th>Room Number</th>

                        <th>Allocation Date</th>

                        <th>Checkout Date</th>

                        <th>Status</th>

                        <th>Actions</th>

                    </tr>

                </thead>


                <tbody>

                    <c:forEach var="allocation"
                               items="${allocations}">

                        <tr>

                            <!-- Allocation ID -->

                            <td>
                                ${allocation.id}
                            </td>


                            <!-- Student ID -->

                            <td>
                                ${allocation.studentId}
                            </td>


                            <!-- Student Name -->

                            <td>

                                <c:choose>

                                    <c:when test="${not empty allocation.studentName}">

                                        ${allocation.studentName}

                                    </c:when>

                                    <c:otherwise>

                                        N/A

                                    </c:otherwise>

                                </c:choose>

                            </td>


                            <!-- Room ID -->

                            <td>
                                ${allocation.roomId}
                            </td>


                            <!-- Room Number -->

                            <td>

                                <c:choose>

                                    <c:when test="${not empty allocation.roomNumber}">

                                        ${allocation.roomNumber}

                                    </c:when>

                                    <c:otherwise>

                                        N/A

                                    </c:otherwise>

                                </c:choose>

                            </td>


                            <!-- Allocation Date -->

                            <td>

                                <c:choose>

                                    <c:when test="${not empty allocation.allocationDate}">

                                        ${allocation.allocationDate}

                                    </c:when>

                                    <c:otherwise>

                                        -

                                    </c:otherwise>

                                </c:choose>

                            </td>


                            <!-- Checkout Date -->

                            <td>

                                <c:choose>

                                    <c:when test="${not empty allocation.checkoutDate}">

                                        ${allocation.checkoutDate}

                                    </c:when>

                                    <c:otherwise>

                                        -

                                    </c:otherwise>

                                </c:choose>

                            </td>


                            <!-- Status -->

                            <td>
                                ${allocation.status}
                            </td>


                            <!-- Actions -->

                            <td>

                                <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payment/history?allocationId=${allocation.id}">
                                    Payment History
                                </a>

                                &nbsp; | &nbsp;


                                <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/allocation/edit?id=${allocation.id}">
                                    Edit
                                </a>

                                &nbsp; | &nbsp;


                                <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/allocation/delete?id=${allocation.id}"
                                   onclick="return confirm('Are you sure you want to delete this allocation?');">
                                    Delete
                                </a>

                            </td>

                        </tr>

                    </c:forEach>

                </tbody>

            </table>

        </c:when>


        <!-- =================================================
             NO DATA
             ================================================= -->

        <c:otherwise>

            <p>
                No room allocations found.
            </p>

        </c:otherwise>

    </c:choose>


    <br>


    <!-- =====================================================
         NAVIGATION
         ===================================================== -->

    <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/dashboard">
        Back to Dashboard
    </a>

</body>

</html>
```

### Ab Allocation List mein ye dikhega

```text
ID | Student ID | Student Name | Room ID | Room Number | Date | Status
```

Example:

```text
1 | 5 | Rahul | 3 | 203 | 2026-09-01 | Active
```

Aur Actions:

```text
[Payment History] [Edit] [Delete]
```

### ⚠️ Ek important check

Agar page open karte hi SQL error aaye:

```text
Unknown column 's.name'
```

ya:

```text
Unknown column 'r.room_number'
```

to **next step par jaane se pehle error mujhe bhejna**. Iska matlab tumhare actual database column names different hain, aur hum SQL ko tumhare exact schema ke according fix karenge.

Agar page successfully open ho gaya, `next` bolo → **Step 58: Allocation + Payment ko properly connect karke student-wise rent summary banayenge.**
